/uploads/2020/08/Artists-Place-Trat1-768x576.jpg 768w, https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Artists-Place-Trat1.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">โรงแรม  </span>Artist&#8217;s Place Trat   <span style=\"color: #000000;\">แห่งนี้ได้รับคะแนนรีวิว 8.1/10 จาก Booking.com และ 8.0/10 คะแนนจาก Agoda.com</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">เลือกเข้าพักได้  1-3 ท่าน</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">ราคา เริ่มต้นห้องละ   510   บาท</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">จองโรงแรม ราคาพิเศษ</span></h6>\n<h6><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=528917\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1893 aligncenter\" src=\"http://topofhotel.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/agodacom.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\" /></span></a></h6>\n<h6><a href=\"https://www.booking.com/hotel/th/artist-s-place-trat.en.html?aid=1670294&amp;no_rooms=1&amp;group_adults=2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-1891 aligncenter\" src=\"http://topofhotel.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/Booking-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\" /></span></a></h6>\n<hr />\n<h4><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=781455\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">9.) Iyara Residence<img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/4-Star.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"145\" height=\"36\" /></a></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=7